# Diagram — class/type relation view for LoopController implementers
#
# Mermaid has no separate first-class UML contract in codrax today, so this
# case exercises the generic diagram contract for a class/type relationship
# view: interface node plus implementer nodes. It also guards that typed
# relation facts are not restricted to enumeration-only paths: log/perf
# pre-stage evaluators and write_analyzer implement LoopController too and
# should remain visible in diagram/mechanism relation answers.
ID="qf_type_relation_loop_controller"
NAME="diagram — type relation LoopController implementers"
QUESTION="请用 Mermaid 类图或类型关系图表示 LoopController 接口和它的主要实现类型之间的关系，并列出每个实现类型所在文件。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="LoopController analyzerEvaluator explorerEvaluator extractorEvaluator answerDocumentEvaluator subExplorerEvaluator logTriagerEvaluator perfTriagerEvaluator writeAnalyzerEvaluator"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX='(```mermaid|classDiagram|flowchart|graph[[:space:]]+(TD|LR))
(answerDocumentEvaluator|finalizer.*Evaluator|plannerEvaluator|verifierEvaluator|writeAnalyzerEvaluator)'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=".java BaseAgent.java StageOutput Dependencies ToolSchemaFilter streamPreviewBuffer"
